# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1: Map classical inputs to a quantum problem {#step-1-map-classical-inputs-to-a-quantum-problem}"
msgstr "Langkah 1: Petakan input klasik kepada masalah kuantum {#step-1-map-classical-inputs-to-a-quantum-problem}"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hamiltonian and reference state {#hamiltonian-and-reference-state}"
msgstr "Hamiltonian dan keadaan rujukan {#hamiltonian-and-reference-state}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This example uses a 12-qubit open-boundary Heisenberg chain ($n=12$),\n"
msgstr "Contoh ini menggunakan rantai Heisenberg sempadan-terbuka 12-Qubit ($n=12$),\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"H=\\sum_{i=0}^{n-2}\\left(X_iX_{i+1}+Y_iY_{i+1}+Z_iZ_{i+1}\\right),\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"H=\\sum_{i=0}^{n-2}\\left(X_iX_{i+1}+Y_iY_{i+1}+Z_iZ_{i+1}\\right),\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "with a single-excitation product state\n"
msgstr "dengan keadaan produk pengujaan-tunggal\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"|\\psi_{0}\\rangle=|000001000000\\rangle\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"|\\psi_{0}\\rangle=|000001000000\\rangle\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"as the reference state.\n"
"Because the Heisenberg Hamiltonian defined above conserves the total number of excitations, the reference state stays in the single-excitation subspace, whose dimension grows only linearly with the number of qubits. We can therefore compute the exact ground-state energy efficiently, by diagonalizing the Hamiltonian restricted to that subspace, and use it purely as a diagnostic benchmark for the KQD estimate. The KQD workflow itself estimates projected matrix elements by using Qiskit primitives and solves the resulting projected problem classically.\n"
msgstr ""
"sebagai keadaan rujukan.\n"
"Oleh kerana Hamiltonian Heisenberg yang ditakrifkan di atas mengekalkan jumlah bilangan pengujaan, keadaan rujukan kekal dalam subruang pengujaan-tunggal, yang dimensinya berkembang hanya secara linear dengan bilangan Qubit. Oleh itu kita boleh mengira tenaga keadaan-dasar tepat dengan cekap, dengan mepenjuruan Hamiltonian yang dihadkan kepada subruang tersebut, dan menggunakannya semata-mata sebagai penanda aras diagnostik untuk anggaran KQD. Aliran kerja KQD itu sendiri menganggarkan unsur matriks terunjur menggunakan primitif Qiskit dan menyelesaikan masalah terunjur yang terhasil secara klasik.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set the parameters for the algorithm {#set-the-parameters-for-the-algorithm}"
msgstr "Tetapkan parameter untuk algoritma {#set-the-parameters-for-the-algorithm}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Based on the upper-bounds on the Hamiltonian norm, Ref. [\\[1\\]](#references) heuristically suggests the time step $\\Delta t$ as $\\pi/\\|H\\|$.\n"
"Because the spectral norm $\\|H\\|$ is hard to compute, we instead use its upper bound:\n"
msgstr ""
"Berdasarkan sempadan-atas norma Hamiltonian, Rujukan [\\[1\\]](#references) secara heuristik mencadangkan langkah masa $\\Delta t$ sebagai $\\pi/\\|H\\|$.\n"
"Oleh kerana norma spektrum $\\|H\\|$ sukar dikira, kami sebaliknya menggunakan sempadan atasnya:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"\\|H\\| \\le \\sum_{i=0}^{n-2}\\underbrace{\\|X_i X_{i+1}+Y_{i} Y_{i+1}+Z_{i} Z_{i+1}\\|}_{4 \\times 4 \\text{ matrix, easy to calculate the norm}} = 3(n-1).\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"\\|H\\| \\le \\sum_{i=0}^{n-2}\\underbrace{\\|X_i X_{i+1}+Y_{i} Y_{i+1}+Z_{i} Z_{i+1}\\|}_{4 \\times 4 \\text{ matrix, easy to calculate the norm}} = 3(n-1).\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We set the Krylov dimension to $r=10$ and the number of Trotter steps per time step to $5$: a large enough Krylov space to resolve the low-lying spectrum while keeping the deepest circuit ($t_{\\max}=(r-1)\\Delta t$) affordable, and enough Trotter steps to keep the discretization error small at that deepest circuit.\n"
msgstr "Kami menetapkan dimensi Krylov kepada $r=10$ dan bilangan langkah Trotter setiap langkah masa kepada $5$: ruang Krylov yang cukup besar untuk menyelesaikan spektrum tenaga-rendah sambil mengekalkan Circuit paling dalam ($t_{\\max}=(r-1)\\Delta t$) berpatutan, dan langkah Trotter yang cukup untuk mengekalkan ralat pendiskretan kecil pada Circuit paling dalam tersebut.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build circuit {#build-circuit}"
msgstr "Bina Circuit {#build-circuit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Here, we build the circuits to estimate the matrix elements $\\mathcal{H}_{k\\ell}$ and $\\mathcal{S}_{k\\ell}$.\n"
"Because all powers of $H$ commute, we have\n"
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"\\mathcal{H}_{k\\ell}\n"
"=\n"
msgstr ""
"Di sini, kami membina Circuit untuk menganggarkan unsur matriks $\\mathcal{H}_{k\\ell}$ dan $\\mathcal{S}_{k\\ell}$.\n"
"Oleh kerana semua kuasa $H$ berkomut, kita ada\n"
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"\\mathcal{H}_{k\\ell}\n"
"=\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\langle\\psi_{0}|H e^{-i(\\ell-k)\\Delta tH}|\\psi_{0}\\rangle=\\mathcal{H}_{0,\\ell-k},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\mathcal{S}_{k\\ell}\n"
"=\n"
msgstr ""
"\\langle\\psi_{0}|H e^{-i(\\ell-k)\\Delta tH}|\\psi_{0}\\rangle=\\mathcal{H}_{0,\\ell-k},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\mathcal{S}_{k\\ell}\n"
"=\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\langle\\psi_{0}|e^{-i(\\ell-k)\\Delta tH}|\\psi_{0}\\rangle=\\mathcal{S}_{0,\\ell-k}.\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"
"Such matrices where the elements depend on the index differences in this manner are called *Toeplitz* and can be reconstructed from first-row elements indexed by $d=\\ell-k$.\n"
msgstr ""
"\\langle\\psi_{0}|e^{-i(\\ell-k)\\Delta tH}|\\psi_{0}\\rangle=\\mathcal{S}_{0,\\ell-k}.\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"
"Such matrices where the elements depend on the index differences in this manner are called *Toeplitz* and can be reconstructed from first-row elements indexed by $d=\\ell-k$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Here, we present the circuit, called **extended-swap-test**, which prepares\n"
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"|\\Phi_{0d}\\rangle=\n"
"\\frac{|0\\rangle|\\psi_0\\rangle+|1\\rangle|\\psi_d\\rangle}{\\sqrt{2}},\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"
"where $|\\psi_d\\rangle=e^{-id\\Delta tH}|\\psi_{0}\\rangle$.\n"
msgstr ""
"Di sini, kami mempersembahkan Circuit, dipanggil **extended-swap-test**, yang menyediakan\n"
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"|\\Phi_{0d}\\rangle=\n"
"\\frac{|0\\rangle|\\psi_0\\rangle+|1\\rangle|\\psi_d\\rangle}{\\sqrt{2}},\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"
"dengan $|\\psi_d\\rangle=e^{-id\\Delta tH}|\\psi_{0}\\rangle$.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reference state {#reference-state}"
msgstr "Keadaan rujukan {#reference-state}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We prepare the reference state $|\\psi_0\\rangle$.\n"
msgstr "Kami menyediakan keadaan rujukan $|\\psi_0\\rangle$.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/krylov-quantum-diagonalization/extracted-outputs/fb2879c5-0.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/krylov-quantum-diagonalization/extracted-outputs/fb2879c5-0.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Time evolution {#time-evolution}"
msgstr "Evolusi masa {#time-evolution}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Realize the time-evolution operator generated by the Hamiltonian, approximated by simple [Lie-Trotterization](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.synthesis.LieTrotter).\n"
msgstr "Realisasikan operator evolusi masa yang dihasilkan oleh Hamiltonian, dianggarkan oleh [Lie-Trotterization](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.synthesis.LieTrotter) yang ringkas.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/krylov-quantum-diagonalization/extracted-outputs/017b8548-0.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/krylov-quantum-diagonalization/extracted-outputs/017b8548-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Extended swap test circuit [\\[3\\]](#references) {#extended-swap-test-circuit-3references}"
msgstr "Circuit ujian-tukar lanjutan [\\[3\\]](#references) {#extended-swap-test-circuit-3references}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The circuit first prepares the reference state on the system register while the ancilla remains in $|0\\rangle$:\n"
msgstr "Circuit terlebih dahulu menyediakan keadaan rujukan pada daftar sistem sementara ancilla kekal pada $|0\\rangle$:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"|0\\rangle |0\\rangle^{\\otimes n}\n"
"\\longrightarrow\n"
"|0\\rangle |\\psi_{0}\\rangle .\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"|0\\rangle |0\\rangle^{\\otimes n}\n"
"\\longrightarrow\n"
"|0\\rangle |\\psi_{0}\\rangle .\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Then, applying a Hadamard gate to the ancilla creates a coherent superposition of two branches:\n"
msgstr "Kemudian, mengenakan gate Hadamard kepada ancilla mencipta superposisi koheren bagi dua cabang:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"|0\\rangle |\\psi_0\\rangle\n"
"\\longrightarrow\n"
"\\frac{|0\\rangle + |1\\rangle}{\\sqrt{2}} |\\psi_0\\rangle\n"
"=\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"|0\\rangle |\\psi_0\\rangle\n"
"\\longrightarrow\n"
"\\frac{|0\\rangle + |1\\rangle}{\\sqrt{2}} |\\psi_0\\rangle\n"
"=\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\frac{|0\\rangle|\\psi_0\\rangle + |1\\rangle|\\psi_0\\rangle}{\\sqrt{2}} .\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"\\frac{|0\\rangle|\\psi_0\\rangle + |1\\rangle|\\psi_0\\rangle}{\\sqrt{2}} .\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Finally, the controlled time-evolution gate applies:\n"
msgstr "Akhirnya, gate evolusi masa terkawal dikenakan:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"U(t=d\\Delta t) = e^{-id\\Delta t H}\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"U(t=d\\Delta t) = e^{-id\\Delta t H}\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "only when the ancilla is in the $|1\\rangle$ branch. Therefore,\n"
msgstr "hanya apabila ancilla berada dalam cabang $|1\\rangle$. Oleh itu,\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"\\frac{|0\\rangle|\\psi_0\\rangle + |1\\rangle|\\psi_0\\rangle}{\\sqrt{2}}\n"
"\\longrightarrow\n"
"\\frac{|0\\rangle|\\psi_0\\rangle + |1\\rangle U(d\\Delta t)|\\psi_0\\rangle}{\\sqrt{2}} .\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"\\frac{|0\\rangle|\\psi_0\\rangle + |1\\rangle|\\psi_0\\rangle}{\\sqrt{2}}\n"
"\\longrightarrow\n"
"\\frac{|0\\rangle|\\psi_0\\rangle + |1\\rangle U(d\\Delta t)|\\psi_0\\rangle}{\\sqrt{2}} .\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In the next code block, we implement:\n"
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"|\\Psi(t)\\rangle = \\frac{|0\\rangle|\\psi_0\\rangle + |1\\rangle U(t)|\\psi_0\\rangle}{\\sqrt{2}},\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"
"which will be assigned as $t=d\\Delta t$ for $d=1,\\cdots r-1$ in the execution step.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dalam blok kod seterusnya, kami melaksanakan:\n"
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"|\\Psi(t)\\rangle = \\frac{|0\\rangle|\\psi_0\\rangle + |1\\rangle U(t)|\\psi_0\\rangle}{\\sqrt{2}},\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"
"yang akan ditetapkan sebagai $t=d\\Delta t$ untuk $d=1,\\cdots r-1$ dalam langkah pelaksanaan.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/krylov-quantum-diagonalization/extracted-outputs/1260f66a-0.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/krylov-quantum-diagonalization/extracted-outputs/1260f66a-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Observables {#observables}"
msgstr "Boleh diperhatikan {#observables}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For any Hermitian system observable $O$, here we set the observables to calculate:\n"
msgstr "Untuk sebarang boleh diperhatikan sistem Hermitan $O$, di sini kami menetapkan boleh diperhatikan untuk dikira:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"z=\\langle \\psi_0|O|\\psi_d\\rangle .\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"z=\\langle \\psi_0|O|\\psi_d\\rangle .\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This is because $O=I$ gives the overlap element $\\mathcal{S}_{0d}=\\langle\\psi_0|\\psi_d\\rangle$, while $O=H$ gives the Hamiltonian element $\\mathcal{H}_{0d}=\\langle\\psi_0|H|\\psi_d\\rangle$.\n"
msgstr "Ini kerana $O=I$ memberikan unsur pertindihan $\\mathcal{S}_{0d}=\\langle\\psi_0|\\psi_d\\rangle$, manakala $O=H$ memberikan unsur Hamiltonian $\\mathcal{H}_{0d}=\\langle\\psi_0|H|\\psi_d\\rangle$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Using $X=|0\\rangle\\langle 1|+|1\\rangle\\langle 0|$, we have\n"
msgstr "Menggunakan $X=|0\\rangle\\langle 1|+|1\\rangle\\langle 0|$, kita ada\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{align*}\n"
"\\langle \\Psi_{0d}|X\\otimes O| \\Psi_{0d} \\rangle\n"
"&=\n"
"\\left(\\frac{\\langle0|\\langle\\psi_0| + \\langle1| \\langle\\psi_d|}{\\sqrt{2}}\\right)(X\\otimes O)\\left(\\frac{|0\\rangle|\\psi_0\\rangle + |1\\rangle |\\psi_d\\rangle}{\\sqrt{2}}\\right) \\\\\n"
"&=\n"
"\\frac{1}{2}\n"
"\\left(\n"
"\\langle \\psi_0|O|\\psi_d\\rangle\n"
"+\n"
"\\langle \\psi_d|O|\\psi_0\\rangle\n"
"\\right) \\\\\n"
"&=\n"
"\\frac{z+z^*}{2}\n"
"=\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{align*}\n"
"\\langle \\Psi_{0d}|X\\otimes O| \\Psi_{0d} \\rangle\n"
"&=\n"
"\\left(\\frac{\\langle0|\\langle\\psi_0| + \\langle1| \\langle\\psi_d|}{\\sqrt{2}}\\right)(X\\otimes O)\\left(\\frac{|0\\rangle|\\psi_0\\rangle + |1\\rangle |\\psi_d\\rangle}{\\sqrt{2}}\\right) \\\\\n"
"&=\n"
"\\frac{1}{2}\n"
"\\left(\n"
"\\langle \\psi_0|O|\\psi_d\\rangle\n"
"+\n"
"\\langle \\psi_d|O|\\psi_0\\rangle\n"
"\\right) \\\\\n"
"&=\n"
"\\frac{z+z^*}{2}\n"
"=\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\operatorname{Re} z.\n"
"\\end{align*}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"\\operatorname{Re} z.\n"
"\\end{align*}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Similarly, using $Y=-i|0\\rangle\\langle 1|+i|1\\rangle\\langle 0|$,\n"
msgstr "Begitu juga, menggunakan $Y=-i|0\\rangle\\langle 1|+i|1\\rangle\\langle 0|$,\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{align*}\n"
"\\langle \\Psi_{0d}|Y\\otimes O| \\Psi_{0d} \\rangle\n"
"&=\n"
"\\left(\\frac{\\langle0|\\langle\\psi_0| + \\langle1| \\langle\\psi_d|}{\\sqrt{2}}\\right)(Y\\otimes O)\\left(\\frac{|0\\rangle|\\psi_0\\rangle + |1\\rangle |\\psi_d\\rangle}{\\sqrt{2}}\\right) \\\\\n"
"&=\n"
"\\frac{1}{2}\n"
"\\left(\n"
"-i\\langle \\psi_0|O|\\psi_d\\rangle\n"
"+\n"
"i\\langle \\psi_d|O|\\psi_0\\rangle\n"
"\\right) \\\\\n"
"&=\n"
"\\frac{-iz+iz^*}{2}\n"
"=\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{align*}\n"
"\\langle \\Psi_{0d}|Y\\otimes O| \\Psi_{0d} \\rangle\n"
"&=\n"
"\\left(\\frac{\\langle0|\\langle\\psi_0| + \\langle1| \\langle\\psi_d|}{\\sqrt{2}}\\right)(Y\\otimes O)\\left(\\frac{|0\\rangle|\\psi_0\\rangle + |1\\rangle |\\psi_d\\rangle}{\\sqrt{2}}\\right) \\\\\n"
"&=\n"
"\\frac{1}{2}\n"
"\\left(\n"
"-i\\langle \\psi_0|O|\\psi_d\\rangle\n"
"+\n"
"i\\langle \\psi_d|O|\\psi_0\\rangle\n"
"\\right) \\\\\n"
"&=\n"
"\\frac{-iz+iz^*}{2}\n"
"=\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\operatorname{Im} z.\n"
"\\end{align*}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"\\operatorname{Im} z.\n"
"\\end{align*}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Therefore, we have\n"
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"\\langle \\Phi_{0d}|X\\otimes O|\\Phi_{0d}\\rangle\n"
"=\n"
msgstr ""
"Oleh itu, kita ada\n"
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"\\langle \\Phi_{0d}|X\\otimes O|\\Phi_{0d}\\rangle\n"
"=\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\operatorname{Re}\\langle\\psi_0|O|\\psi_d\\rangle ,\n"
"\\quad\n"
"\\langle \\Phi_{0d}|Y\\otimes O|\\Phi_{0d}\\rangle\n"
"=\n"
msgstr ""
"\\operatorname{Re}\\langle\\psi_0|O|\\psi_d\\rangle ,\n"
"\\quad\n"
"\\langle \\Phi_{0d}|Y\\otimes O|\\Phi_{0d}\\rangle\n"
"=\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\operatorname{Im}\\langle\\psi_0|O|\\psi_d\\rangle .\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"\\operatorname{Im}\\langle\\psi_0|O|\\psi_d\\rangle .\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Finally, for each state $|\\Psi_{0d}\\rangle$, we need to measure:\n"
"$$\n"
"\\begin{align*}\n"
"X \\otimes I \\text{ for } \\operatorname{Re}\\mathcal{S}_{0d},\\\\\n"
"Y \\otimes I \\text{ for } \\operatorname{Im}\\mathcal{S}_{0d},\\\\\n"
"X \\otimes H \\text{ for } \\operatorname{Re}\\mathcal{H}_{0d},\\\\\n"
"Y \\otimes H \\text{ for } \\operatorname{Im}\\mathcal{H}_{0d}.\\\\\n"
"\\end{align*}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"Akhirnya, untuk setiap keadaan $|\\Psi_{0d}\\rangle$, kita perlu mengukur:\n"
"$$\n"
"\\begin{align*}\n"
"X \\otimes I \\text{ for } \\operatorname{Re}\\mathcal{S}_{0d},\\\\\n"
"Y \\otimes I \\text{ for } \\operatorname{Im}\\mathcal{S}_{0d},\\\\\n"
"X \\otimes H \\text{ for } \\operatorname{Re}\\mathcal{H}_{0d},\\\\\n"
"Y \\otimes H \\text{ for } \\operatorname{Im}\\mathcal{H}_{0d}.\\\\\n"
"\\end{align*}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For the estimation of the $\\mathcal{H}$ matrix elements, the number of Pauli terms is much larger than that for the $\\mathcal{S}$ matrix elements.\n"
msgstr "Untuk anggaran unsur matriks $\\mathcal{H}$, bilangan sebutan Pauli jauh lebih besar daripada unsur matriks $\\mathcal{S}$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We can now reduce the number of measured Hamiltonian terms by using a shifting technique [\\[4\\]](#references).\n"
"We split the Hamiltonian as:\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita kini boleh mengurangkan bilangan sebutan Hamiltonian yang diukur dengan menggunakan teknik anjakan [\\[4\\]](#references).\n"
"Kita membahagikan Hamiltonian sebagai:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"H = (H-T) + T,\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"H = (H-T) + T,\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "where $T$ is chosen such that the reference state is its eigenstate,\n"
msgstr "dengan $T$ dipilih sedemikian rupa sehingga keadaan rujukan adalah keadaan eigennya,\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"T|\\psi_0\\rangle = \\tau |\\psi_0\\rangle .\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"T|\\psi_0\\rangle = \\tau |\\psi_0\\rangle .\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Then,\n"
msgstr "Then,\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{align*}\n"
"\\mathcal{H}_{0d}\n"
"&=\n"
"\\langle\\psi_0|H|\\psi_d\\rangle \\\\\n"
"&=\n"
"\\langle\\psi_0|(H-T)|\\psi_d\\rangle\n"
"+\n"
"\\langle\\psi_0|T|\\psi_d\\rangle \\\\\n"
"&=\n"
"\\langle\\psi_0|(H-T)|\\psi_d\\rangle\n"
"+\n"
"\\tau \\langle\\psi_0|\\psi_d\\rangle \\\\\n"
"&=\n"
"\\widetilde{\\mathcal{H}}_{0d}\n"
"+\n"
"\\tau \\mathcal{S}_{0d}.\n"
"\\end{align*}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{align*}\n"
"\\mathcal{H}_{0d}\n"
"&=\n"
"\\langle\\psi_0|H|\\psi_d\\rangle \\\\\n"
"&=\n"
"\\langle\\psi_0|(H-T)|\\psi_d\\rangle\n"
"+\n"
"\\langle\\psi_0|T|\\psi_d\\rangle \\\\\n"
"&=\n"
"\\langle\\psi_0|(H-T)|\\psi_d\\rangle\n"
"+\n"
"\\tau \\langle\\psi_0|\\psi_d\\rangle \\\\\n"
"&=\n"
"\\widetilde{\\mathcal{H}}_{0d}\n"
"+\n"
"\\tau \\mathcal{S}_{0d}.\n"
"\\end{align*}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Here,\n"
msgstr "Here,\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"\\widetilde{\\mathcal{H}}_{0d}\n"
"=\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"\\widetilde{\\mathcal{H}}_{0d}\n"
"=\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\langle\\psi_0|(H-T)|\\psi_d\\rangle\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"\\langle\\psi_0|(H-T)|\\psi_d\\rangle\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"is the shifted Hamiltonian matrix element.\n"
"Therefore, we only need to measure $X\\otimes (H-T)$ and $Y\\otimes (H-T)$.\n"
"The contribution from $T$ is reconstructed classically using the already measured overlap matrix element $\\mathcal{S}_{0d}$.\n"
msgstr ""
"ialah unsur matriks Hamiltonian teranjak.\n"
"Oleh itu, kita hanya perlu mengukur $X\\otimes (H-T)$ dan $Y\\otimes (H-T)$.\n"
"Sumbangan daripada $T$ dibina semula secara klasik menggunakan unsur matriks pertindihan $\\mathcal{S}_{0d}$ yang telah diukur.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In this example, a natural choice is the diagonal part of the Heisenberg Hamiltonian,\n"
msgstr "Dalam contoh ini, pilihan semula jadi adalah bahagian pepenjuru Hamiltonian Heisenberg,\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"T\n"
"=\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"T\n"
"=\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\sum_{i=0}^{n-2} Z_iZ_{i+1}.\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"\\sum_{i=0}^{n-2} Z_iZ_{i+1}.\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Because the reference state is a computational-basis state, it is an eigenstate of every $Z_iZ_{i+1}$ term.\n"
msgstr "Oleh kerana keadaan rujukan adalah keadaan asas-pengiraan, ia adalah keadaan eigen bagi setiap sebutan $Z_iZ_{i+1}$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "However, a more advantageous choice is to include not only the diagonal $ZZ$ terms, but also the $XX+YY$ terms that annihilate the reference state.\n"
msgstr "Walau bagaimanapun, pilihan yang lebih menguntungkan adalah dengan menyertakan bukan sahaja sebutan pepenjuru $ZZ$, tetapi juga sebutan $XX+YY$ yang memusnahkan keadaan rujukan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For each neighboring pair, the operator $XX+YY$ satisfies\n"
msgstr "Untuk setiap pasangan bersebelahan, operator $XX+YY$ memenuhi\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"(XX+YY)|00\\rangle = 0,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"(XX+YY)|11\\rangle = 0,\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"(XX+YY)|00\\rangle = 0,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"(XX+YY)|11\\rangle = 0,\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "and\n"
msgstr "and\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"(XX+YY)|01\\rangle = 2|10\\rangle,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"(XX+YY)|10\\rangle = 2|01\\rangle .\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"(XX+YY)|01\\rangle = 2|10\\rangle,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"(XX+YY)|10\\rangle = 2|01\\rangle .\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Therefore, the $XX+YY$ term contributes only when the two neighboring qubits have different occupations in the reference bitstring.\n"
"If the two qubits are both $0$ or both $1$, the term annihilates the reference state and can also be shifted out.\n"
msgstr ""
"Oleh itu, sebutan $XX+YY$ hanya menyumbang apabila dua Qubit bersebelahan mempunyai penghunian berbeza dalam bitstring rujukan.\n"
"Jika kedua-dua Qubit adalah $0$ atau kedua-duanya $1$, sebutan itu memusnahkan keadaan rujukan dan juga boleh dianjakkan keluar.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Let $|\\psi_{\\rm ref}\\rangle = |z_0\\cdots z_{n-1}\\rangle$, where $z_i \\in \\{0,1\\}$.\n"
"Thus, we can choose\n"
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"T=\\sum_{i=0}^{n-2} Z_iZ_{i+1}\n"
"+\n"
"\\sum_{z_i={z_{i+1}}}\n"
"\\left(\n"
"X_iX_{i+1}\n"
"+\n"
"Y_iY_{i+1}\n"
"\\right).\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"Biar $|\\psi_{\\rm ref}\\rangle = |z_0\\cdots z_{n-1}\\rangle$, dengan $z_i \\in \\{0,1\\}$.\n"
"Oleh itu, kita boleh memilih\n"
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"T=\\sum_{i=0}^{n-2} Z_iZ_{i+1}\n"
"+\n"
"\\sum_{z_i={z_{i+1}}}\n"
"\\left(\n"
"X_iX_{i+1}\n"
"+\n"
"Y_iY_{i+1}\n"
"\\right).\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This operator still satisfies\n"
msgstr "Operator ini masih memenuhi\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"T|\\psi_0\\rangle = \\tau |\\psi_0\\rangle ,\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"T|\\psi_0\\rangle = \\tau |\\psi_0\\rangle ,\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"because the $ZZ$ terms act diagonally on $|\\psi_0\\rangle$, while the shifted $XX+YY$ terms give zero.\n"
"The corresponding eigenvalue is therefore determined only by the $ZZ$ terms,\n"
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"\\tau = \\sum_{i=0}^{n-2}\n"
"(-1)^{z_i}\n"
"(-1)^{z_{i+1}} .\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"kerana sebutan $ZZ$ bertindak secara pepenjuru pada $|\\psi_0\\rangle$, manakala sebutan $XX+YY$ teranjak memberikan sifar.\n"
"Nilai eigen yang sepadan oleh itu ditentukan hanya oleh sebutan $ZZ$,\n"
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"\\tau = \\sum_{i=0}^{n-2}\n"
"(-1)^{z_i}\n"
"(-1)^{z_{i+1}} .\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"With this choice, the shifted Hamiltonian becomes:\n"
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"H-T = \\sum_{z_i\\ne z_{i+1}}\n"
"\\left(\n"
"X_iX_{i+1}\n"
"+\n"
"Y_iY_{i+1}\n"
"\\right).\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"Dengan pilihan ini, Hamiltonian teranjak menjadi:\n"
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"H-T = \\sum_{z_i\\ne z_{i+1}}\n"
"\\left(\n"
"X_iX_{i+1}\n"
"+\n"
"Y_iY_{i+1}\n"
"\\right).\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"As a result, only the edges with different occupations in the reference state need to be measured.\n"
"All $ZZ$ terms and all inactive $XX+YY$ terms are reconstructed through the overlap contribution $\\tau \\mathcal{S}_{0d}$, or give zero contribution by construction.\n"
msgstr ""
"Hasilnya, hanya tepi dengan penghunian berbeza dalam keadaan rujukan yang perlu diukur.\n"
"Semua sebutan $ZZ$ dan semua sebutan $XX+YY$ tidak aktif dibina semula melalui sumbangan pertindihan $\\tau \\mathcal{S}_{0d}$, atau memberikan sumbangan sifar mengikut binaan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This gives a smaller observable than shifting only the diagonal part.\n"
"In particular, for a computational-basis reference state with a localized excitation, only the edges adjacent to the excitation remain in $H-T$.\n"
"Therefore, the number of Pauli terms in $X\\otimes(H-T)$ and $Y\\otimes(H-T)$ can be substantially reduced, while the reconstructed matrix element\n"
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"\\widetilde{\\mathcal{H}}_{0d}\n"
"+\n"
"\\tau \\mathcal{S}_{0d}\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"Ini memberikan boleh diperhatikan yang lebih kecil daripada menganjak hanya bahagian pepenjuru.\n"
"Secara khusus, untuk keadaan rujukan asas-pengiraan dengan pengujaan tersetempat, hanya tepi bersebelahan dengan pengujaan tersebut kekal dalam $H-T$.\n"
"Oleh itu, bilangan sebutan Pauli dalam $X\\otimes(H-T)$ dan $Y\\otimes(H-T)$ boleh dikurangkan dengan ketara, sementara unsur matriks yang dibina semula\n"
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"\\widetilde{\\mathcal{H}}_{0d}\n"
"+\n"
"\\tau \\mathcal{S}_{0d}\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "remains exactly the same.\n"
msgstr "kekal sama sepenuhnya.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 2: Optimize problem for quantum hardware execution {#step-2-optimize-problem-for-quantum-hardware-execution}"
msgstr "Langkah 2: Optimumkan masalah untuk pelaksanaan perkakasan kuantum {#step-2-optimize-problem-for-quantum-hardware-execution}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now we turn the abstract extended-swap-test circuit into a hardware-oriented template.\n"
"Before that, we further optimize the circuit in the abstract level first.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kini kita mengubah Circuit ujian-tukar lanjutan abstrak menjadi templat berorientasikan perkakasan.\n"
"Sebelum itu, kita terlebih dahulu mengoptimumkan lagi Circuit di peringkat abstrak.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compare Hamiltonian term ordering {#compare-hamiltonian-term-ordering}"
msgstr "Bandingkan susunan sebutan Hamiltonian {#compare-hamiltonian-term-ordering}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"First, we compare different orderings of the Pauli terms in the Heisenberg Hamiltonian for the Hamiltonian simulation.\n"
"The Hamiltonian itself is unchanged, but the ordering affects how the product-formula circuit is generated and how much the structure can be parallelized in the circuit.\n"
"For example, the naive ordering lists all nearest-neighbor $XX$ terms, then all $YY$ terms, then all $ZZ$ terms.\n"
"This places adjacent edges such as $(0,1)$ and $(1,2)$ next to each other, so they cannot be executed in parallel.\n"
"The even-then-odd ordering visits disjoint even edges first, followed by odd edges, which exposes parallel two-qubit layers.\n"
"The even-odd edge-grouped ordering goes one step further: for each edge, it keeps the local $XX$, $YY$, and $ZZ$ terms together, while still visiting even edges before odd edges.\n"
"We expect the even-then-odd and even-odd edge-grouped orderings to reduce circuit depth by exposing parallel two-qubit layers, and the edge-grouped ordering to additionally reduce the Trotter error because the local two-qubit interaction on the same edge is handled as a compact block.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pertama, kita bandingkan susunan berbeza sebutan Pauli dalam Hamiltonian Heisenberg untuk simulasi Hamiltonian.\n"
"Hamiltonian itu sendiri tidak berubah, tetapi susunan mempengaruhi cara Circuit formula-produk dijana dan sejauh mana struktur boleh diselaraskan dalam Circuit.\n"
"Sebagai contoh, susunan naif menyenaraikan semua sebutan $XX$ jiran-terdekat, kemudian semua sebutan $YY$, kemudian semua sebutan $ZZ$.\n"
"Ini meletakkan tepi bersebelahan seperti $(0,1)$ dan $(1,2)$ bersebelahan antara satu sama lain, jadi ia tidak boleh dilaksanakan secara selari.\n"
"Susunan genap-kemudian-ganjil melawati tepi genap yang saling terpisah dahulu, diikuti tepi ganjil, yang mendedahkan lapisan dwi-Qubit selari.\n"
"Susunan tepi-berkumpulan genap-ganjil pergi selangkah lebih jauh: untuk setiap tepi, ia mengekalkan sebutan tempatan $XX$, $YY$, dan $ZZ$ bersama-sama, sambil masih melawati tepi genap sebelum tepi ganjil.\n"
"Kita menjangkakan susunan genap-kemudian-ganjil dan tepi-berkumpulan genap-ganjil mengurangkan kedalaman Circuit dengan mendedahkan lapisan dwi-Qubit selari, dan susunan tepi-berkumpulan tambahan mengurangkan ralat Trotter kerana interaksi dwi-Qubit tempatan pada tepi yang sama dikendalikan sebagai blok padat.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Pauli evolutions with different term ordering](/docs/images/tutorials/krylov-quantum-diagonalization/ham_ordering.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Pauli evolutions with different term ordering](/docs/images/tutorials/krylov-quantum-diagonalization/ham_ordering.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Hamiltonian ordering also affects the Trotter error.\n"
"If we place noncommuting terms next to each other, the basis transitions occur more often, which induces more Trotter error.\n"
"By grouping terms that require the same Pauli-basis transformation, redundant basis-changes can be avoided.\n"
msgstr ""
"Susunan Hamiltonian juga mempengaruhi ralat Trotter.\n"
"Jika kita meletakkan sebutan tidak berkomut bersebelahan antara satu sama lain, peralihan asas berlaku lebih kerap, yang menyebabkan lebih banyak ralat Trotter.\n"
"Dengan mengumpulkan sebutan yang memerlukan transformasi asas-Pauli yang sama, perubahan asas yang berlebihan boleh dielakkan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Here, the comparison uses the largest evolution time that appears in the first-row Krylov estimates,\n"
"$t_{\\max} = (r-1)\\Delta t,$\n"
"using the same transpilation condition.\n"
msgstr ""
"Di sini, perbandingan menggunakan masa evolusi terbesar yang muncul dalam anggaran Krylov baris-pertama,\n"
"$t_{\\max} = (r-1)\\Delta t,$\n"
"menggunakan keadaan transpilasi yang sama.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In order to measure the Trotter error, we use **process infidelity** between the Trotterized circuit and the exact Hamiltonian evolution,\n"
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"\\text{Infidelity}(U,V)\n"
"=\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk mengukur ralat Trotter, kita menggunakan **ketidaksetiaan proses** antara Circuit Trotter dan evolusi Hamiltonian tepat,\n"
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"\\text{Infidelity}(U,V)\n"
"=\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"1-F(U,V)\n"
"=\n"
msgstr ""
"1-F(U,V)\n"
"=\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"1 - \\frac{|\\operatorname{Tr}(U^\\dagger V)|^2}{d^2},\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"
"where $d=2^n$ is the dimension of the Hilbert space.\n"
msgstr ""
"1 - \\frac{|\\operatorname{Tr}(U^\\dagger V)|^2}{d^2},\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"
"where $d=2^n$ is the dimension of the Hilbert space.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This diagnostic uses dense matrices, so it is suitable for this small 12-qubit example but not intended as a scalable subroutine.\n"
msgstr "Diagnostik ini menggunakan matriks padat, jadi ia sesuai untuk contoh 12-Qubit kecil ini tetapi tidak dimaksudkan sebagai subrutin boleh skala.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We first keep the synthesis rule fixed to one first-order Trotter step and vary only the Pauli-term ordering.\n"
"The goal of this comparison is mainly to see how much circuit depth and two-qubit cost can be reduced by exposing disjoint nearest-neighbor edges to the transpiler.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita mula-mula mengekalkan peraturan sintesis tetap pada satu langkah Trotter tertib-pertama dan hanya mengubah susunan sebutan Pauli.\n"
"Matlamat perbandingan ini adalah terutamanya untuk melihat sejauh mana kedalaman Circuit dan kos dwi-Qubit boleh dikurangkan dengan mendedahkan tepi jiran-terdekat yang terpisah kepada Transpiler.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/krylov-quantum-diagonalization/extracted-outputs/21eaab38-1.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/krylov-quantum-diagonalization/extracted-outputs/21eaab38-1.avif)\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/krylov-quantum-diagonalization/extracted-outputs/21eaab38-3.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/krylov-quantum-diagonalization/extracted-outputs/21eaab38-3.avif)\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/krylov-quantum-diagonalization/extracted-outputs/21eaab38-5.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/krylov-quantum-diagonalization/extracted-outputs/21eaab38-5.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"At `reps=1`, we observe that even-then-odd and even-odd edge-grouped orderings both collapse the depth from 15 to 6 by exposing parallel two-qubit layers, while the two-qubit gate count stays the same across all three orderings.\n"
"However, all three orderings have infidelity close to 1, so we sweep the number of Trotter repetitions to separate the orderings more clearly.\n"
"As the number of repetitions grows, the infidelity of `even-odd edge-grouped` ordering drops faster than the other two, reaching 0.045 at `reps=8` versus 0.075 for naive and even-then-odd ordering.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pada `reps=1`, kita perhatikan bahawa susunan genap-kemudian-ganjil dan tepi-berkumpulan genap-ganjil kedua-duanya mengecutkan kedalaman daripada 15 kepada 6 dengan mendedahkan lapisan dwi-Qubit selari, sementara kiraan gate dwi-Qubit kekal sama merentasi ketiga-tiga susunan.\n"
"Walau bagaimanapun, ketiga-tiga susunan mempunyai ketidaksetiaan hampir 1, jadi kita mengimbas bilangan pengulangan Trotter untuk memisahkan susunan dengan lebih jelas.\n"
"Apabila bilangan pengulangan bertambah, ketidaksetiaan susunan `even-odd edge-grouped` jatuh lebih pantas daripada dua yang lain, mencapai 0.045 pada `reps=8` berbanding 0.075 untuk susunan naif dan genap-kemudian-ganjil.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compare product-formula synthesis {#compare-product-formula-synthesis}"
msgstr "Bandingkan sintesis formula-produk {#compare-product-formula-synthesis}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Next, we explore different advanced settings of Trotterization, with the fixed Hamiltonian ordering to the even-odd edge-grouped ordering.\n"
"We consider first-order Lie-Trotter, second-order Suzuki-Trotter, and fourth-order Suzuki-Trotter.\n"
msgstr ""
"Seterusnya, kita meneroka tetapan lanjutan berbeza bagi Trotterisasi, dengan susunan Hamiltonian tetap kepada susunan tepi-berkumpulan genap-ganjil.\n"
"Kita pertimbangkan Lie-Trotter tertib-pertama, Suzuki-Trotter tertib-kedua, dan Suzuki-Trotter tertib-keempat.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Lie-Trotter gives the shallowest circuit but has the largest error, while the fourth-order Suzuki-Trotter is more accurate but increases the circuit depth.\n"
"For the rest of the tutorial, we choose second-order Suzuki-Trotter because it gives a small-depth circuit while substantially reducing the Trotter error relative to the first-order formula.\n"
msgstr ""
"Lie-Trotter memberikan Circuit paling cetek tetapi mempunyai ralat paling besar, manakala Suzuki-Trotter tertib-keempat lebih tepat tetapi meningkatkan kedalaman Circuit.\n"
"Untuk baki tutorial ini, kita memilih Suzuki-Trotter tertib-kedua kerana ia memberikan Circuit kedalaman-kecil sambil mengurangkan ralat Trotter dengan ketara berbanding formula tertib-pertama.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remove the controlled time-evolution gate {#remove-the-controlled-time-evolution-gate}"
msgstr "Buang gate evolusi masa terkawal {#remove-the-controlled-time-evolution-gate}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In the extended swap test, controlling time evolution with a single ancilla qubit requires the ancilla to control many gates across the system.\n"
"This can introduce substantial routing overhead and, in the worst case, effectively requires all-to-one connectivity.\n"
"To avoid this, further optimization is possible by replacing the controlled time-evolution gate with a control-free version, exploiting the symmetry of the Hamiltonian.\n"
"Let's observe the following circuit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dalam ujian-tukar lanjutan, mengawal evolusi masa dengan satu Qubit ancilla memerlukan ancilla mengawal banyak gate merentasi sistem.\n"
"Ini boleh memperkenalkan overhead penghalaan yang besar dan, dalam kes terburuk, secara berkesan memerlukan kesambungan semua-kepada-satu.\n"
"Untuk mengelakkan ini, pengoptimuman lanjut boleh dilakukan dengan menggantikan gate evolusi masa terkawal dengan versi bebas-kawalan, mengeksploitasi simetri Hamiltonian.\n"
"Mari kita perhatikan Circuit berikut.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![circuit optimization](/docs/images/tutorials/krylov-quantum-diagonalization/circuit_opt.avif)\n"
msgstr "![circuit optimization](/docs/images/tutorials/krylov-quantum-diagonalization/circuit_opt.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Here, $B_{\\rm ref}$ prepares the reference state, $B_{\\rm ref}|0^n\\rangle = |\\psi_{0}\\rangle$.\n"
msgstr "Di sini, $B_{\\rm ref}$ menyediakan keadaan rujukan, $B_{\\rm ref}|0^n\\rangle = |\\psi_{0}\\rangle$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Instead of first preparing $\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|0\\rangle+|1\\rangle)|\\psi_0\\rangle$ and then applying $U(t)$ only on the $|1\\rangle$ branch, the circuit directly prepares the two branches as\n"
msgstr "Berbanding menyediakan $\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|0\\rangle+|1\\rangle)|\\psi_0\\rangle$ dahulu dan kemudian mengenakan $U(t)$ hanya pada cabang $|1\\rangle$, Circuit terus menyediakan dua cabang sebagai\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"|0\\rangle|\\psi_0\\rangle\n"
"\\quad \\text{and} \\quad\n"
"|1\\rangle|\\psi_d\\rangle ,\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"|0\\rangle|\\psi_0\\rangle\n"
"\\quad \\text{and} \\quad\n"
"|1\\rangle|\\psi_d\\rangle ,\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "where\n"
msgstr "where\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"|\\psi_d\\rangle = U(d\\Delta t)|\\psi_0\\rangle .\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"|\\psi_d\\rangle = U(d\\Delta t)|\\psi_0\\rangle .\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The circuit first applies a Hadamard gate to the ancilla and prepares the reference state only on the $|1\\rangle$ branch:\n"
msgstr "Circuit terlebih dahulu mengenakan gate Hadamard kepada ancilla dan menyediakan keadaan rujukan hanya pada cabang $|1\\rangle$:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"|0\\rangle |0^n\\rangle\n"
"\\longrightarrow\n"
"\\frac{|0\\rangle |0^n\\rangle + |1\\rangle B_{\\rm ref}|0^n\\rangle}{\\sqrt{2}}\n"
"=\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"|0\\rangle |0^n\\rangle\n"
"\\longrightarrow\n"
"\\frac{|0\\rangle |0^n\\rangle + |1\\rangle B_{\\rm ref}|0^n\\rangle}{\\sqrt{2}}\n"
"=\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\frac{|0\\rangle |0^n\\rangle + |1\\rangle |\\psi_0\\rangle}{\\sqrt{2}} .\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"\\frac{|0\\rangle |0^n\\rangle + |1\\rangle |\\psi_0\\rangle}{\\sqrt{2}} .\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Then the uncontrolled time-evolution operator is applied to both branches:\n"
msgstr "Kemudian operator evolusi masa tanpa-kawalan dikenakan pada kedua-dua cabang:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"\\frac{|0\\rangle |0^n\\rangle + |1\\rangle |\\psi_0\\rangle}{\\sqrt{2}}\n"
"\\longrightarrow\n"
"\\frac{|0\\rangle U(t)|0^n\\rangle + |1\\rangle U(t)|\\psi_0\\rangle}{\\sqrt{2}} .\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"\\frac{|0\\rangle |0^n\\rangle + |1\\rangle |\\psi_0\\rangle}{\\sqrt{2}}\n"
"\\longrightarrow\n"
"\\frac{|0\\rangle U(t)|0^n\\rangle + |1\\rangle U(t)|\\psi_0\\rangle}{\\sqrt{2}} .\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Since the Hamiltonian preserves the excitation number, we can see that $|0^n\\rangle$ is its eigenstate, and thus\n"
"the evolution operator only accumulates a phase under the Hamiltonian:\n"
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"U(t)|0^n\\rangle\n"
"=\n"
msgstr ""
"Oleh kerana Hamiltonian mengekalkan bilangan pengujaan, kita boleh lihat bahawa $|0^n\\rangle$ adalah keadaan eigennya, dan oleh itu\n"
"operator evolusi hanya mengumpul fasa di bawah Hamiltonian:\n"
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"U(t)|0^n\\rangle\n"
"=\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"e^{-iE_{\\rm vac}t}|0^n\\rangle .\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"e^{-iE_{\\rm vac}t}|0^n\\rangle .\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Therefore,\n"
msgstr "Therefore,\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"\\frac{|0\\rangle U(t)|0^n\\rangle + |1\\rangle U(t)|\\psi_0\\rangle}{\\sqrt{2}}\n"
"=\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"\\frac{|0\\rangle U(t)|0^n\\rangle + |1\\rangle U(t)|\\psi_0\\rangle}{\\sqrt{2}}\n"
"=\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\frac{e^{-iE_{\\rm vac}t}|0\\rangle |0^n\\rangle + |1\\rangle U(t)|\\psi_0\\rangle}{\\sqrt{2}} .\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"\\frac{e^{-iE_{\\rm vac}t}|0\\rangle |0^n\\rangle + |1\\rangle U(t)|\\psi_0\\rangle}{\\sqrt{2}} .\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, $B_{\\rm ref}$ is applied only on the $|0\\rangle$ branch.\n"
msgstr "Seterusnya, $B_{\\rm ref}$ dikenakan hanya pada cabang $|0\\rangle$.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"\\frac{e^{-iE_{\\rm vac}t}|0\\rangle |\\psi_0\\rangle + |1\\rangle U(t)|\\psi_0\\rangle}{\\sqrt{2}} .\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"\\frac{e^{-iE_{\\rm vac}t}|0\\rangle |\\psi_0\\rangle + |1\\rangle U(t)|\\psi_0\\rangle}{\\sqrt{2}} .\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "At this point, the two branches have an extra relative phase. To remove it, we apply the ancilla phase gate\n"
msgstr "Pada titik ini, kedua-dua cabang mempunyai fasa relatif tambahan. Untuk mengeluarkannya, kita mengaplikasikan gate fasa ancilla\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"P(-E_{\\rm vac}t)\n"
"=\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"P(-E_{\\rm vac}t)\n"
"=\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"1 & 0 \\\\\n"
"0 & e^{-iE_{\\rm vac}t}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}.\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"1 & 0 \\\\\n"
"0 & e^{-iE_{\\rm vac}t}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}.\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This transforms the state as\n"
msgstr "Ini mentransformasikan keadaan sebagai\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"\\frac{e^{-iE_{\\rm vac}t}|0\\rangle |\\psi_0\\rangle + |1\\rangle U(t)|\\psi_0\\rangle}{\\sqrt{2}}\n"
"\\longrightarrow\n"
"\\frac{e^{-iE_{\\rm vac}t}|0\\rangle |\\psi_0\\rangle\n"
"+\n"
"e^{-iE_{\\rm vac}t}|1\\rangle U(t)|\\psi_0\\rangle}{\\sqrt{2}} .\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"\\frac{e^{-iE_{\\rm vac}t}|0\\rangle |\\psi_0\\rangle + |1\\rangle U(t)|\\psi_0\\rangle}{\\sqrt{2}}\n"
"\\longrightarrow\n"
"\\frac{e^{-iE_{\\rm vac}t}|0\\rangle |\\psi_0\\rangle\n"
"+\n"
"e^{-iE_{\\rm vac}t}|1\\rangle U(t)|\\psi_0\\rangle}{\\sqrt{2}} .\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Thus, up to an irrelevant global phase, we finally prepared\n"
msgstr "Oleh itu, sehingga fasa global yang tidak relevan, kita akhirnya menyediakan\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"|\\Phi_{0d}\\rangle\n"
"=\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"|\\Phi_{0d}\\rangle\n"
"=\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\frac{\n"
"|0\\rangle|\\psi_0\\rangle\n"
"+\n"
"|1\\rangle U(t)|\\psi_0\\rangle\n"
"}{\\sqrt{2}} .\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"\\frac{\n"
"|0\\rangle|\\psi_0\\rangle\n"
"+\n"
"|1\\rangle U(t)|\\psi_0\\rangle\n"
"}{\\sqrt{2}} .\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In the next code block, we implement this control-free circuit.\n"
msgstr "Dalam blok kod seterusnya, kita mengimplementasikan Circuit bebas kawalan ini.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/krylov-quantum-diagonalization/extracted-outputs/790e5e0c-1.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/krylov-quantum-diagonalization/extracted-outputs/790e5e0c-1.avif)\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transpilation {#transpilation}"
msgstr "Transpilation {#transpilation}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now, we transpile the controlled- and control-free circuits to become executable on the hardware.\n"
"Let's compare the result of the transpiled circuits.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sekarang, kita transpile Circuit terkawal dan bebas kawalan supaya boleh dijalankan pada perkakasan.\n"
"Mari kita bandingkan hasil Circuit yang telah ditranspile.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3: Execute using Qiskit primitives {#step-3-execute-using-qiskit-primitives}"
msgstr "Langkah 3: Laksanakan menggunakan primitif Qiskit {#step-3-execute-using-qiskit-primitives}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The next step is to submit the same parameterized circuit for several values of $d$. For each $d$, we estimate four expectation values: $X\\otimes I$, $Y\\otimes I$, $X\\otimes (H-T)$, and $Y\\otimes (H-T)$. These four numbers are then combined into the complex first-row elements $\\mathcal{S}_{0d}$ and $\\mathcal{H}_{0d}$.\n"
msgstr "Langkah seterusnya ialah menghantar Circuit berparameter yang sama untuk beberapa nilai $d$. Untuk setiap $d$, kita menganggarkan empat nilai jangkaan: $X\\otimes I$, $Y\\otimes I$, $X\\otimes (H-T)$, dan $Y\\otimes (H-T)$. Keempat-empat nombor ini kemudian digabungkan menjadi elemen baris pertama kompleks $\\mathcal{S}_{0d}$ dan $\\mathcal{H}_{0d}$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Here, $\\mathcal{S}_{00}=1$ and $\\mathcal{H}_{00}=\\langle\\psi_{0}|(H-T)|\\psi_{0}\\rangle=\\langle\\psi_{0}|H|\\psi_{0}\\rangle-\\tau$ can be classically calculated since $\\lvert\\psi_0\\rangle$ is sparse, so we skip the $d=0$ case.\n"
msgstr "Di sini, $\\mathcal{S}_{00}=1$ dan $\\mathcal{H}_{00}=\\langle\\psi_{0}|(H-T)|\\psi_{0}\\rangle=\\langle\\psi_{0}|H|\\psi_{0}\\rangle-\\tau$ boleh dikira secara klasik kerana $\\lvert\\psi_0\\rangle$ adalah jarang, jadi kita langkau kes $d=0$.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 4: Post-process and return result in desired classical format {#step-4-post-process-and-return-result-in-desired-classical-format}"
msgstr "Langkah 4: Pascaproses dan kembalikan hasil dalam format klasik yang dikehendaki {#step-4-post-process-and-return-result-in-desired-classical-format}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After estimating the projected matrices, we regularize and solve the GEVP\n"
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"\\mathcal{H}\\mathbf{c} = E\\mathcal{S}\\mathbf{c}.\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"
"The smallest generalized eigenvalue gives the KQD estimate of the ground-state energy.\n"
msgstr ""
"Selepas menganggarkan matriks terunjur, kita menormalkan dan menyelesaikan GEVP\n"
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"\\mathcal{H}\\mathbf{c} = E\\mathcal{S}\\mathbf{c}.\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"
"Nilai eigen umum yang terkecil memberikan anggaran KQD bagi tenaga keadaan asas.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now we solve the generalized eigenvalue problem using the matrices reconstructed from the circuit estimates.\n"
"In an ideal statevector calculation with exact real-time evolution, this should reproduce the exact projected result.\n"
"In practice, deviations can come from Trotterization, sampling error, and numerical instability of the overlap matrix.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sekarang kita menyelesaikan masalah nilai eigen umum menggunakan matriks yang dibina semula daripada anggaran Circuit.\n"
"Dalam pengiraan vektor keadaan ideal dengan evolusi masa nyata yang tepat, ini sepatutnya menghasilkan semula hasil terunjur yang tepat.\n"
"Dalam praktiknya, penyimpangan boleh datang daripada Trotterization, ralat pensampelan, dan ketidakstabilan berangka bagi matriks pertindihan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We observe how the energy converges as we increase the dimension of the Krylov subspace.\n"
msgstr "Kita perhatikan bagaimana tenaga menumpu apabila kita meningkatkan dimensi subruang Krylov.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/krylov-quantum-diagonalization/extracted-outputs/08d57f33-0.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/krylov-quantum-diagonalization/extracted-outputs/08d57f33-0.avif)\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Large-scale hardware example {#large-scale-hardware-example}"
msgstr "Large-scale hardware example {#large-scale-hardware-example}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The previous section used a 12-qubit model so that the statevector simulation could be used as a diagnostic. We now scale the same KQD workflow to a 30-qubit Heisenberg chain and prepare the workload for execution on IBM Quantum hardware.\n"
msgstr "Bahagian sebelumnya menggunakan model 12-qubit supaya simulasi vektor keadaan boleh digunakan sebagai diagnostik. Kita kini menskalakan aliran kerja KQD yang sama kepada rantai Heisenberg 30-qubit dan menyediakan beban kerja untuk dijalankan pada perkakasan IBM Quantum.\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Steps 1-4 compressed into a single code block {#steps-1-4-compressed-into-a-single-code-block}"
msgstr "Steps 1-4 compressed into a single code block {#steps-1-4-compressed-into-a-single-code-block}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Here we now put all of these details together into a singular workflow at a larger scale, which is then run on our real quantum hardware. In this section, we apply realistic error-mitigation settings to improve the reliability of the results. Since the matrix elements corresponding to different values of $d$ can be evaluated in parallel, we use `Batch` mode to execute them efficiently.\n"
msgstr "Di sini kita kini menggabungkan semua butiran ini menjadi satu aliran kerja tunggal pada skala yang lebih besar, yang kemudian dijalankan pada perkakasan kuantum sebenar kita. Dalam bahagian ini, kita mengaplikasikan tetapan mitigasi ralat yang realistik untuk meningkatkan kebolehpercayaan hasil. Oleh kerana elemen matriks yang berkaitan dengan nilai $d$ yang berbeza boleh dinilai secara selari, kita menggunakan mod `Batch` untuk melaksanakannya dengan cekap.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/krylov-quantum-diagonalization/extracted-outputs/e3e0d1f3-1.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/krylov-quantum-diagonalization/extracted-outputs/e3e0d1f3-1.avif)\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Appendix: The Hamiltonian-function (spectral-filter) viewpoint {#appendix-the-hamiltonian-function-spectral-filter-viewpoint}"
msgstr "Appendix: The Hamiltonian-function (spectral-filter) viewpoint {#appendix-the-hamiltonian-function-spectral-filter-viewpoint}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The main workflow presented KQD operationally: build a Krylov basis from real-time-evolved states, estimate the projected matrices $\\mathcal{H}$ and $\\mathcal{S}$, and solve the GEVP.\n"
"This appendix revisits the *same* computation from a complementary angle that explains **why** KQD works: the *Hamiltonian-function*, or *spectral-filter*, viewpoint [\\[3\\]](#references), [\\[5\\]](#references).\n"
"It reuses the 12-qubit model, time step $\\Delta t$, and the Krylov solution already obtained above; no new circuit execution is required.\n"
msgstr ""
"Aliran kerja utama membentangkan KQD secara operasi: membina asas Krylov daripada keadaan yang berevolusi dalam masa nyata, menganggarkan matriks terunjur $\\mathcal{H}$ dan $\\mathcal{S}$, dan menyelesaikan GEVP.\n"
"Lampiran ini mengunjungi semula pengiraan yang *sama* daripada sudut pandangan pelengkap yang menerangkan **mengapa** KQD berfungsi: sudut pandangan *fungsi-Hamiltonian*, atau *penapis-spektrum* [\\[3\\]](#references), [\\[5\\]](#references).\n"
"Ia menggunakan semula model 12-qubit, langkah masa $\\Delta t$, dan penyelesaian Krylov yang telah diperoleh di atas; tiada pelaksanaan Circuit baharu diperlukan.\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "The reference state as an energy distribution {#the-reference-state-as-an-energy-distribution}"
msgstr "The reference state as an energy distribution {#the-reference-state-as-an-energy-distribution}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Let the Hamiltonian have the eigendecomposition\n"
msgstr "Biarkan Hamiltonian mempunyai penguraian eigen\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"H=\\sum_{m} E_m\\,|E_m\\rangle\\!\\langle E_m|,\n"
"\\qquad E_0\\le E_1\\le\\cdots,\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"H=\\sum_{m} E_m\\,|E_m\\rangle\\!\\langle E_m|,\n"
"\\qquad E_0\\le E_1\\le\\cdots,\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"with energy eigenstates $|E_m\\rangle$.\n"
"Any reference state can be expanded in this eigenbasis,\n"
msgstr ""
"dengan keadaan eigen tenaga $|E_m\\rangle$.\n"
"Mana-mana keadaan rujukan boleh dikembangkan dalam asas eigen ini,\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"|\\psi_{0}\\rangle=\\sum_m a_m\\,|E_m\\rangle,\n"
"\\qquad a_m=\\langle E_m|\\psi_{0}\\rangle,\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"|\\psi_{0}\\rangle=\\sum_m a_m\\,|E_m\\rangle,\n"
"\\qquad a_m=\\langle E_m|\\psi_{0}\\rangle,\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"so it carries a **spectral weight** $p_m=|a_m|^2$ at each energy $E_m$.\n"
"The reference energy is the mean of this distribution, $\\langle H\\rangle_{0}=\\sum_m p_m E_m$.\n"
msgstr ""
"jadi ia membawa **berat spektrum** $p_m=|a_m|^2$ pada setiap tenaga $E_m$.\n"
"Tenaga rujukan ialah min bagi taburan ini, $\\langle H\\rangle_{0}=\\sum_m p_m E_m$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The eigendecomposition of a general $n$-qubit Hamiltonian is exponentially costly, so this picture is only a diagnostic, which is *not* part of the algorithm.\n"
"Here, however, we can compute it cheaply for the *same* $n=12$ problem: the Heisenberg Hamiltonian conserves the total excitation number, and the reference $|000001000000\\rangle$ carries a single excitation, so its entire spectral content lives in the single-excitation subspace whose dimension grows only linearly with $n$.\n"
"We therefore reuse the exact single-excitation block (already used above as a benchmark) and read off the reference distribution $\\{(E_m, p_m)\\}$ inside that subspace.\n"
msgstr ""
"Penguraian eigen bagi Hamiltonian $n$-qubit am adalah mahal secara eksponen, jadi gambaran ini hanyalah diagnostik, yang *bukan* sebahagian daripada algoritma.\n"
"Di sini, bagaimanapun, kita boleh mengiranya dengan murah untuk masalah $n=12$ yang *sama*: Hamiltonian Heisenberg mengekalkan jumlah nombor pengujaan, dan rujukan $|000001000000\\rangle$ membawa satu pengujaan tunggal, jadi seluruh kandungan spektrumnya berada dalam subruang pengujaan tunggal yang dimensinya hanya berkembang secara linear dengan $n$.\n"
"Oleh itu kita menggunakan semula blok pengujaan tunggal yang tepat (yang telah digunakan di atas sebagai penanda aras) dan membaca taburan rujukan $\\{(E_m, p_m)\\}$ dalam subruang tersebut.\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "KQD learns a filter that reshapes this distribution {#kqd-learns-a-filter-that-reshapes-this-distribution}"
msgstr "KQD learns a filter that reshapes this distribution {#kqd-learns-a-filter-that-reshapes-this-distribution}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A **Hamiltonian function** $f(H)$ is defined through spectral calculus,\n"
msgstr "Satu **fungsi Hamiltonian** $f(H)$ ditakrifkan melalui kalkulus spektrum,\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"f(H)=\\sum_m f(E_m)\\,|E_m\\rangle\\!\\langle E_m|,\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"f(H)=\\sum_m f(E_m)\\,|E_m\\rangle\\!\\langle E_m|,\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"or in other words, a weighted sum of eigenprojectors.\n"
"Applying it to the reference reshapes each spectral amplitude, $a_m \\to a_m f(E_m)$:\n"
msgstr ""
"atau dengan kata lain, satu jumlah berpemberat bagi eigen-projektor.\n"
"Mengaplikasikannya kepada rujukan membentuk semula setiap amplitud spektrum, $a_m \\to a_m f(E_m)$:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"f(H)\\,|\\psi_{0}\\rangle=\\sum_m a_m\\,f(E_m)\\,|E_m\\rangle .\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"f(H)\\,|\\psi_{0}\\rangle=\\sum_m a_m\\,f(E_m)\\,|E_m\\rangle .\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If $f$ were sharply peaked at the lowest energy ($f(E_0)=1$ and $f(E_m)\\approx 0$ otherwise) then $f(H)$ would act as a ground-state projector, and the normalized output would be (close to) the ground state.\n"
"Therefore, a good low-pass **spectral filter** in energy is exactly what we want.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika $f$ dipuncak dengan tajam pada tenaga terendah ($f(E_0)=1$ dan $f(E_m)\\approx 0$ selainnya) maka $f(H)$ akan bertindak sebagai projektor keadaan asas, dan output ternormal akan menjadi (hampir) keadaan asas.\n"
"Oleh itu, satu **penapis spektrum** laluan-rendah yang baik dalam tenaga adalah tepat apa yang kita mahukan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "KQD does not prescribe $f$ in advance. Instead it expands the filter in the real-time-evolution basis,\n"
msgstr "KQD tidak menetapkan $f$ terlebih dahulu. Sebaliknya ia mengembangkan penapis dalam asas evolusi masa nyata,\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"f_{\\rm KQD}(E)=\\sum_{\\ell=0}^{r-1} c_\\ell\\, e^{-i\\ell\\Delta t E},\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"f_{\\rm KQD}(E)=\\sum_{\\ell=0}^{r-1} c_\\ell\\, e^{-i\\ell\\Delta t E},\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"a *trigonometric* function of the energy whose coefficients $\\{c_\\ell\\}$ are precisely the GEVP eigenvector solved for above.\n"
"Minimizing the Rayleigh quotient $\\mathbf{c}^\\dagger\\mathcal{H}\\mathbf{c}/\\mathbf{c}^\\dagger\\mathcal{S}\\mathbf{c}$ is therefore the same as *learning* the filter that best suppresses the excited-state weight of the reference.\n"
"Larger Krylov dimension $r$ gives the filter more degrees of freedom and a sharper peak at the ground-state energy.\n"
msgstr ""
"satu fungsi *trigonometri* bagi tenaga yang pekalinya $\\{c_\\ell\\}$ adalah tepat vektor eigen GEVP yang diselesaikan di atas.\n"
"Meminimumkan hasil bagi Rayleigh $\\mathbf{c}^\\dagger\\mathcal{H}\\mathbf{c}/\\mathbf{c}^\\dagger\\mathcal{S}\\mathbf{c}$ oleh itu adalah sama seperti *mempelajari* penapis yang paling baik menekan berat keadaan teruja bagi rujukan.\n"
"Dimensi Krylov $r$ yang lebih besar memberikan penapis lebih darjah kebebasan dan puncak yang lebih tajam pada tenaga keadaan asas.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The helper below evaluates this learned filter on an energy axis; we then apply it to the reference distribution obtained above.\n"
msgstr "Pembantu di bawah menilai penapis yang dipelajari ini pada paksi tenaga; kita kemudian mengaplikasikannya kepada taburan rujukan yang diperoleh di atas.\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Visualize the filter and its flexibility {#visualize-the-filter-and-its-flexibility}"
msgstr "Visualize the filter and its flexibility {#visualize-the-filter-and-its-flexibility}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We first show the learned filter at the full Krylov dimension used above, then track how it sharpens as the dimension $r$ grows.\n"
msgstr "Kita mula-mula menunjukkan penapis yang dipelajari pada dimensi Krylov penuh yang digunakan di atas, kemudian menjejaki bagaimana ia menajamkan apabila dimensi $r$ berkembang.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The bars show the reference spectral weights $p_m$ (before) and the filtered weights $p_m|f_{\\rm KQD}(E_m)|^2$ (after), together with the learned filter intensity $|f_{\\rm KQD}(E)|^2$ on a continuous energy axis.\n"
"The filter concentrates the weight onto the lowest energy of the single-excitation subspace &mdash; the same energy that the KQD estimate converged to in the small-scale example.\n"
"Note that this is the ground state *within the single-excitation sector*, which is the relevant target for this excitation-conserving reference state, not the global ground state.\n"
msgstr ""
"Bar menunjukkan berat spektrum rujukan $p_m$ (sebelum) dan berat tertapis $p_m|f_{\\rm KQD}(E_m)|^2$ (selepas), bersama dengan keamatan penapis yang dipelajari $|f_{\\rm KQD}(E)|^2$ pada paksi tenaga berterusan.\n"
"Penapis menumpukan berat kepada tenaga terendah subruang pengujaan tunggal &mdash; tenaga yang sama yang anggaran KQD menumpu kepadanya dalam contoh skala kecil.\n"
"Perhatikan bahawa ini adalah keadaan asas *dalam sektor pengujaan tunggal*, yang merupakan sasaran relevan bagi keadaan rujukan pengekalan pengujaan ini, bukan keadaan asas global.\n"

